#: ../../source/module/settings.md:1 b4a8485b2b1949feaeedc8075b650739
msgid "设置（Settings）"
msgstr "Settings"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:3 9de26f7dd2eb41299eb364f8b0737255
msgid ""
"`Settings` 用来调整显示、导入导出、NEP 后端和绘图样式。刚开始不需要全部改；只有当你遇到加载慢、显示卡顿、预测慢、导出格式不符合下游要求，或想切换 "
"CPU/CUDA 后端时，再来这里。"
msgstr ""
"Use `Settings` to adjust rendering, import and export behavior, the NEP backend, and "
"plot styles. You do not need to tune everything at first. Change a setting when you "
"encounter slow loading or rendering, slow prediction, an incompatible export format, "
"or a need to switch between CPU and CUDA."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:5 d1fe25b5213243688f7946c6b94ecc70
msgid "先改哪些"
msgstr "Choose the relevant setting"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 8a7fce664e4745f4b8d9fba068ca2c88
msgid "你遇到的问题"
msgstr "What you observe"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d7a0ca6e74984e05be3f728256ec3371
msgid "可以看哪个设置"
msgstr "Setting to check"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 4316c01573874378be8dab1ca0391010
msgid "影响"
msgstr "Effect"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md f79cbc0bb7204ffa9985c094876b566c
msgid "大结构显示卡顿"
msgstr "Large structures render slowly"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 8bf19f11c0e84ee79e3ffd8eaf36d89a
msgid "`Canvas Engine`"
msgstr "`Canvas Engine`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 4183f7de3048442090cfe08d69366f1f
msgid "在 `Auto` / `PyQtGraph` / `VisPy` 间切换结构和散点渲染后端"
msgstr ""
"Switch the structure and scatter rendering backend among `Auto`, `PyQtGraph`, and "
"`VisPy`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 8b4172fd03ef4839b5b4b82bcb0b3abb
msgid "力图数值不符合习惯"
msgstr "Force plots use an unfamiliar scale"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 1976528dab5c4714aaef5a4e9708c077
msgid "`Force data format`"
msgstr "`Force data format`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d087d68cb41c4f94af8130c75445c68e
msgid "在原始力和归一化显示之间切换"
msgstr "Switch between raw-force and normalized display"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md a52977283a604d8a905695f7e4229f96
msgid "打开目录时不想自动加载"
msgstr "Opening a directory should not trigger automatic loading"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 7326437b243a46f7a47245f9bcff1443
msgid "`Auto loading`"
msgstr "`Auto loading`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 56b696e6185e46aea7386c58ac7b8dd8
msgid "控制是否自动读取启动路径里的相关结果文件"
msgstr "Control whether related result files in the startup path are loaded automatically"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md cd2b9ac9abde420295f0c4c3e430fa3b
msgid "卡片处理时原子顺序影响观察"
msgstr "Atom order makes card outputs difficult to inspect"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 0d5dd9bdbf2a448d9283c2339134496f
msgid "`Sort atoms`"
msgstr "`Sort atoms`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d8fbac35dddf456f891d9a60deedc732
msgid "处理结构时按元素顺序重排原子"
msgstr "Sort atoms by element while processing structures"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d96b3ad18b3f4e68a064d095f4d40201
msgid "卡片菜单太拥挤"
msgstr "The card menu is crowded"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md ef21672fe01d49ae87d43d9f8032a128
msgid "`Use card group menu`"
msgstr "`Use card group menu`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md dfb5205df5df412d96982361d7473eb9
msgid "按卡片 `group` 分组显示 生成数据集 菜单"
msgstr "Group the `Make Dataset` menu by card `group`."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d4009ad86c0b412a89c15421e6a1685d
msgid "反复打开同一批输出较慢"
msgstr "Reopening the same outputs is slow"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md b0d175b6130d40e3a36b00f1f3546160
msgid "`Cache output files`"
msgstr "`Cache output files`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md c871fd967fb042bf8c712bf5bfdf0f99
msgid "缓存 `*.out` 和 `descriptor.out`，减少重复解析"
msgstr "Cache `*.out` and `descriptor.out` files to avoid repeated parsing"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 9baea05df7c74d4ba6dc2a959dc4f3ec
msgid "导出小数位不合适"
msgstr "Exported numeric precision is unsuitable"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md b5a84653ccd5497c83e5eed149ea7307
msgid "`Export significant digits`"
msgstr "`Export significant digits`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d523e8f30101467a9a5ecd0ac4e2523f
msgid "控制 `xyz` / `extxyz` 中逐原子数值的有效数字"
msgstr "Set the significant digits for per-atom values in `xyz` and `extxyz`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md 069e2300b0bb411383991853cf64028a
msgid "源文件没有 `Config_type`"
msgstr "Source structures have no `Config_type`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md f9a42c3ae11f41f0bda04bed4d18eb93
msgid "`Default Config_type`"
msgstr "`Default Config_type`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d42ee47f1a3642138b5713025b99a63f
msgid "给缺少标签的结构补默认来源标签"
msgstr "Assign a default provenance label when one is missing"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md e4ecba281eab42acab721c56f6d35870
msgid "非物理结构检测太松或太严"
msgstr "Nonphysical-structure detection is too permissive or too strict"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md bc0f9928820e45fd98b2058325566560
msgid "`Covalent radius coefficient`"
msgstr "`Covalent radius coefficient`"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md d7fdc458d25b48e8af83e1ca34d8374f
msgid "调整近邻距离判据"
msgstr "Adjust the nearest-neighbor distance criterion"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:19 d39c7a4c857c40fda7fc3d46259a6208
msgid ""
"DeepMD 的标准/Mixed 格式和标准 NPY 的 `Config_type`/化学式分组方式已移到 `NEP Dataset Display` "
"的导出弹窗。程序会记住上次选择，但它们不再占用通用设置页。"
msgstr ""
"The standard/Mixed DeepMD format choice and the standard NPY grouping choice "
"(`Config_type` or chemical formula) have moved to the `NEP Dataset Display` export "
"dialog. The program remembers the last selections, but they no longer occupy the "
"general Settings page."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:22 b39300872d37439c923f26cbf2aa7c12
msgid "NEP 后端"
msgstr "NEP backend"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:24 4e65d83b4b6942c68b7ab7e541f03011
msgid "`NEP Backend` 控制预测时使用 CPU、CUDA，还是由程序自动选择。"
msgstr ""
"`NEP Backend` controls whether prediction uses CPU, CUDA, or automatic backend "
"selection."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:26 3ead8a38dc4a48b0aec2fdb3611a46f5
msgid "`Auto`：默认路径；CUDA 可用且当前模型受支持时使用 CUDA，否则在任务开始前明确提示并使用 CPU。运行中不会静默切换后端。"
msgstr ""
"`Auto`: the default path. It uses CUDA when available and supported by the current "
"model; otherwise it explains the decision before the task starts and uses CPU. It "
"does not silently switch backend during execution."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:27 05d9a494b1e8432d964dcfd2991a640a
msgid "`CPU`：适合没有可用 GPU、驱动不匹配，或只是少量结构快速查看。"
msgstr ""
"`CPU`: use when no compatible GPU is available or when inspecting only a few "
"structures."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:28 c979b8ecf3fa4b6aa5f9372ab22266a6
msgid "`CUDA`：明确要求 NVIDIA CUDA 后端；不可用时直接报错并说明驱动或安装问题。"
msgstr ""
"`CUDA`: explicitly require the NVIDIA CUDA backend. If unavailable, the application "
"reports the driver or installation problem instead of changing backend."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:30 a8f93a888370441bb4cdaa85f4e73434
msgid ""
"`NEP Chunk Max Atoms` 决定一次预测分块包含的总原子数，CPU 和 CUDA 使用相同语义。遇到显存或内存不足时调小；单个结构本身超过 CUDA "
"可用规模时应改用 CPU，因为单结构不能安全拆分。"
msgstr ""
"`NEP Chunk Max Atoms` sets the total atom count allowed in one prediction chunk, with"
" the same meaning on CPU and CUDA. Reduce it when device or host memory is "
"insufficient. If one structure alone exceeds the CUDA capacity, use CPU because a "
"single structure cannot be split safely."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:32 1d885540c61147aea05cb251bd97284a
msgid "`Data Precision` 控制导入 DFT/结构数据后的存储精度。常规可保持默认；只有在内存压力明显或需要保留更高精度数值时再改。"
msgstr ""
"`Data Precision` controls the storage precision of imported DFT and structure data. "
"Keep the default for normal work. Change it only to address clear memory pressure or "
"a requirement to retain higher-precision values."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:34 0e788ed2989943268633300bff489bf4
msgid ""
"`NEP Settings` 中的运行时健康项会显示 NepTrainKit 原生辅助模块、`nep-adapters` 版本以及 CPU/CUDA 可用状态。点击 "
"`NEP runtime updates` 可以从 PyPI "
"手动检查兼容更新。每次打开软件后也会在后台执行一次运行时检查：没有更新或网络检查失败时保持静默，发现新版本时弹出安装提示。程序会校验 wheel 的 "
"SHA256，并在独立进程中确认导入和 CPU 后端可用后才切换版本；更新在重启 NepTrainKit 后生效。验证失败时继续使用原版本。"
msgstr ""
"The runtime health section under `NEP Settings` reports NepTrainKit's native helper "
"modules, the `nep-adapters` version, and CPU/CUDA availability. Use `NEP runtime "
"updates` to check PyPI manually for a compatible update. The application also checks "
"once in the background after startup: no-update and network-failure results remain "
"silent, while an available version opens an installation prompt. Before activation, "
"NepTrainKit verifies the wheel SHA256 and uses an isolated process to confirm that it"
" imports and that the CPU backend is usable. The update takes effect after restarting"
" NepTrainKit; a failed validation leaves the existing version active."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:36 68a3c3b2067243afb260c0e2db0c730a
msgid ""
"通过 pip 安装 NepTrainKit 时，更新后的运行时保存在用户配置目录；Nuitka 独立版则保存在 `NepTrainKit.exe` 旁的 `runtime"
"/nep-adapters/versions`，当前版和上一版会保留用于恢复。"
msgstr ""
"For a pip installation, updated runtimes are stored in the user configuration "
"directory. In a standalone Nuitka build, they are stored next to `NepTrainKit.exe` "
"under `runtime/nep-adapters/versions`; the current and previous versions are retained"
" for recovery."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:38 302fddf6ed234a638cc10db030b816f0
msgid "绘图和结构显示"
msgstr "Plots and structure rendering"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:40 8c65a744bd9843688ac6ead18e64c86a
msgid "Plot Settings 只影响显示，不改变底层数据。"
msgstr "Plot Settings affect presentation only; they do not alter the underlying data."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:42 a45e23f474ba4d56aca6337ead22aaf9
msgid "`Scatter edge color` / `Scatter face color` / `Face alpha`：散点默认颜色和透明度。"
msgstr ""
"`Scatter edge color`, `Scatter face color`, and `Face alpha`: default scatter colors "
"and opacity."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:43 8905023fbe514a00832a233648e2afb5
msgid "`PyQtGraph scatter size` / `VisPy scatter size` / `VisPy antialias`：不同画布后端的点大小和抗锯齿。"
msgstr ""
"`PyQtGraph scatter size`, `VisPy scatter size`, and `VisPy antialias`: point size and"
" antialiasing for each canvas backend."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:44 767edd6558494cf9965e145611ccccfa
msgid "`Structure background` / `Lattice line color`：结构视图背景和晶格线颜色。"
msgstr ""
"`Structure background` and `Lattice line color`: background and cell-line colors in "
"the structure view."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:45 c4f017ba91c641469e5ffa726180165c
msgid ""
"`Selected color` / `Show color` / `Current marker color` / `Current marker "
"size`：选中点、高亮点和当前结构标记的显示样式。"
msgstr ""
"`Selected color`, `Show color`, `Current marker color`, and `Current marker size`: "
"styles for selected points, highlighted points, and the current-structure marker."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:47 31b443422d8e478fab30d28f30a7a151
msgid "如果只是想判断结构是否异常，优先调整点大小和当前结构标记；不要为了配色反复改变数据筛选流程。"
msgstr ""
"When the goal is to spot anomalous structures, adjust point size and the current-"
"structure marker first. Do not change the filtering workflow merely to compensate for"
" plot colors."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:49 a2a37bc203c5442fb470d23e8fed6944
msgid "NEP89 和更新"
msgstr "NEP89 and software updates"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:51 9c13cea99e5a42cd8b0d2b936aa5c744
msgid ""
"`About NEP89` 会检查并更新内置 `nep89.txt`。NEP89 "
"可以用于某些候选结构的快速预筛，但它不是所有材料体系的可靠模型。使用时把它当作异常结构筛查工具，不要当作 DFT 标签来源。"
msgstr ""
"`About NEP89` checks for and updates the bundled `nep89.txt`. NEP89 can quickly "
"prescreen candidates for some systems, but it is not reliable for every material. Use"
" it to flag anomalies, never as a source of DFT labels."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:53 fad2428b89014dc89d163c754cbaf154
msgid "如果你有当前体系自己的 NEP 模型，优先使用自己的模型做预筛。"
msgstr ""
"If a NEP model trained for the current system is available, prefer it for "
"prescreening."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:55 48a260f27cdd45b0873cebcf06af8144
msgid "`About` 里的 `Check for Updates` 用于检查 NepTrainKit 新版本。这个检查只影响软件版本提示，不会自动修改你的训练数据。"
msgstr ""
"`Check for Updates` under `About` checks for a newer NepTrainKit release. It only "
"updates the version notification and never modifies training data automatically."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:57 b863b219e86c4e9abbe8d97a4ca7c7f5
msgid "修改设置的原则"
msgstr "Guidelines for changing settings"

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:59 418920b47eee42cea80e6b6c177014a7
msgid "先确认问题属于显示、读取、预测、导出还是卡片流程，再改对应设置。"
msgstr ""
"First determine whether the problem is in rendering, input, prediction, export, or "
"the card workflow, then change only the corresponding setting."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:60 f384c750b8be4d8e84abf8986041a364
msgid "一次只改一个关键选项，方便判断影响。"
msgstr "Change one important option at a time so its effect remains attributable."

#: ../../source/module/settings.md:61 05b1fbc1c4a341edad5340bc1ad7f2c0
msgid "涉及数据清洗阈值时，改完要抽查被选中的结构，而不是只看数量变化。"
msgstr ""
"After changing a data-cleaning threshold, inspect some of the selected structures "
"rather than judging the change only by the count."

